{"seq":3,"slug":"engagement-metrics-experiment-attribution","title":"互动效果度量与实验归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/engagement-platform-metrics/engagement-metrics-experiment-attribution","wordCount":2878,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"互动效果度量与实验归因\">互动效果度量与实验归因</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-互动度量是-归因-增量-两件互不顺从的事\">核心概念：互动度量是「归因 + 增量」两件互不顺从的事</h2><p>把「评价激励带来了多少复购」当成一个查询问题（跑一条 SQL 看给发过券的人是否买得更多）在方法论上是错的。归因（attribution）回答「这笔转化算给谁」，增量（incrementality）回答「如果没做这件事，转化会少多少」；前者分配已有转化，后者估计反事实。同一份数据的答案可以相差数倍：一条索评触达在归因口径下拿到 30% 的复购贡献，在增量口径下的提升可能只有 2 个百分点——那 30% 里大部分本来就会复购。这个裂缝因为两件事在 2024–2026 年被显著放大。</p>\n<p>第一件是<strong>跨站标识的收缩</strong>。Google 在 2025-04-22 宣布不再通过新的 Chrome 提示淘汰第三方 Cookie，改为维持「用户可自行管理第三方 Cookie」的现状（<a href=\"https://privacysandbox.google.com/blog/privacy-sandbox-next-steps\">Privacy Sandbox — Next steps</a>）。身份不再被一次性抽走，但用户级跨站追踪也不再可靠；度量必须在<strong>聚合、带噪、延迟</strong>的上报通道上重建。Attribution Reporting API 正是这种形态：汇总报告在受信执行环境（TEE）内解密并加噪，第三方无法读取单条报告内容（<a href=\"https://privacysandbox.google.com/private-advertising/attribution-reporting\">Attribution Reporting API</a>，更新于 2025-12-18）。iOS 侧走得更远：AdAttributionKit 随 iOS 18（2024-09-16）发布成为 SKAdNetwork 的继任者，依靠签名回传与「人群匿名阈值」而非 IDFA（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/adattributionkit\">Apple — AdAttributionKit</a>）。</p>\n<p>第二件是<strong>归因模型本身在退场</strong>。GA4 已在 2023 年 11 月移除首次点击、线性、时间衰减与位置型归因模型，只保留数据驱动、末次点击等三种；转化可在发生后再归因至多 7 天（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/10596866\">GA4 — Attribution models</a>）。可选项减少意味着<strong>噪声被挤进链路而非被模型吸收</strong>，必须由实验设计兜底。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;互动动作&lt;br/&gt;索评/推送/引导&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;度量口径&quot;}&#10;  B -- 归因 --&gt; C[&quot;分配已发生的转化&lt;br/&gt;末次点击/数据驱动&quot;]&#10;  B -- 增量 --&gt; D[&quot;估计反事实&lt;br/&gt;holdout/switchback/geo&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;观测偏差&lt;br/&gt;选择效应/归因窗口&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;实验偏差&lt;br/&gt;溢出/遗留/多重比较&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;校准层&lt;br/&gt;预实验协变量 CUPED&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;可决策的增量结论&lt;br/&gt;置信区间 + 最小可检测效应&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"互动动作&lt;br/&gt;索评/推送/引导\"] --&gt; B{\"度量口径\"}\n  B -- 归因 --&gt; C[\"分配已发生的转化&lt;br/&gt;末次点击/数据驱动\"]\n  B -- 增量 --&gt; D[\"估计反事实&lt;br/&gt;holdout/switchback/geo\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"观测偏差&lt;br/&gt;选择效应/归因窗口\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"实验偏差&lt;br/&gt;溢出/遗留/多重比较\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"校准层&lt;br/&gt;预实验协变量 CUPED\"]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[\"可决策的增量结论&lt;br/&gt;置信区间 + 最小可检测效应\"]</pre><h2 id=\"指标分层-从触达漏斗到增量价值\">指标分层：从触达漏斗到增量价值</h2><p>一个可运营的互动度量是<strong>四层结构</strong>，下层为上层提供可信度证据：缺了下层，上层数字无法被解释；缺了上层，度量停在虚荣指标上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>代表指标</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>L1 触达</strong></td>\n<td>触达量、送达率、打开率、退订率</td>\n<td>动作是否真的到了用户</td>\n<td>把「发送成功」当成「被看见」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>L2 行为</strong></td>\n<td>评价提交率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、引导完成率、点击率</td>\n<td>用户是否响应</td>\n<td>用同一批重度用户刷高分母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>L3 结果</strong></td>\n<td>复购率、客单价、退货率、CLV</td>\n<td>业务是否变好</td>\n<td>归因口径把自然复购算进增量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>L4 增量</strong></td>\n<td>每触达增量转化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、增量 ROI</td>\n<td>若不做会怎样</td>\n<td>无 holdout 时的自欺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L1/L2 是运营仪表盘，每天可看；L3 需要控制混杂，跨渠道的 L3 数字在无实验时<strong>不可用于因果陈述</strong>；L4 只有在存在对照组时才成立。跨境的额外约束是<strong>时区与结算日</strong>：妥投时区与仓库记账日可相差 8–13 小时，按自然日聚合 L1 会系统性错配，因此 L1 的聚合维度是「收件人当地日」，L3 的收入维度是「平台结算日」——两套日历要在口径中显式分开。</p>\n<p>增量 ROI 的一个可用形式设每触达增量转化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、每转化边际毛利 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、单次触达成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>iROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{iROI} = \\frac{\\Delta \\cdot m - c_s}{c_s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">iROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 必须来自实验而非按渠道切分的收入；这个式子把「无 holdout 的归因收入」<strong>结构性排除</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因链路-在带噪-延迟-聚合的上报上重建\">归因链路：在带噪、延迟、聚合的上报上重建</h2><p>归因链路落地为三段：<strong>事件采集 → 归因判定 → 聚合上报</strong>。跨境场景下<strong>归因不能在客户端最后一跳完成</strong>——支付、妥投、退款分散在不同系统与时刻，归属必须在服务端按业务事实判定。三个必须显式建模的约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>归因窗口是业务事实而非固定常数。</strong> 索评触达的转化窗口不能按通用 30 天照抄：评价提交在妥投后 3–7 天，其下游复购窗口应挂在<strong>评价提交时刻</strong>而非触达时刻。窗口起点随事件链漂移——这正是<a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-event-bus-state-machine\">购后事件总线与状态机</a>要解决的问题：状态迁移时刻就是归因窗口的合法起点。</li>\n<li><strong>加噪与阈值造成的长尾缺失要显式补偿。</strong> Attribution Reporting 的汇总报告在 TEE 内解密并加噪，第三方只能得到 JSON 汇总；iOS 签名回传还受「人群匿名阈值」约束，低于阈值的事件根本不回传（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/adattributionkit\">Apple — AdAttributionKit</a>）。结果是<strong>小量市场与小众品类的长尾转化系统性缺失</strong>。做法是保留一个<strong>内部服务端归因链</strong>（订单系统自有、非跨站的身份关联）作为决策主口径，隐私上报只作跨渠道校准。</li>\n<li><strong>末次点击之外要留出「非直接」路径的记账位置。</strong> 索评邮件带来的回访常表现为「直接访问 + 站内搜索下单」，末次点击会把功劳记给直接流量并丢弃（GA4 末次点击类模型忽略直接访问）。因此应自带一条<strong>基于触达 ID 的服务端归因</strong>（触达时下发可与订单关联的 campaign 参数），与平台通用模型并行、互不覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实验设计-holdout-switchback-与-geo-的适用边界\">实验设计：holdout、switchback 与 geo 的适用边界</h2><p>增量只能由随机化得到。互动场景有三种可用的实验单元，选择依据是<strong>处理效应的作用半径</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>随机化单元</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>主要偏差来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>用户级 A/B + holdout</strong></td>\n<td>用户</td>\n<td>处理不跨用户外溢</td>\n<td>溢出、样本比例失衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Switchback（时间切换）</strong></td>\n<td>时间片</td>\n<td>共享资源池/运力/库存</td>\n<td>遗留效应、时段混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Geo / 地域切断</strong></td>\n<td>地理簇</td>\n<td>无法在用户级隔离的渠道动作</td>\n<td>跨区溢出、簇不独立</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>用户级 A/B + holdout</strong> —— 索评、评价激励、安装引导这类<strong>一对一触达</strong>的首选：给一批符合条件的用户完全不发触达，作为长期增量基线。常见错误是 holdout 建立后无人维护、被运营「优化」掉；应把比例写进配置由自动化执行，且<strong>对 holdout 组的订单必须打标</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>Switchback</strong> —— 处理占用同一池库存、运力或客服工时时用。用户级随机化会让对照组间接受到处理组影响，标准 A/B 会给出错误结论；此时按时间片切换，全员在同一时段接受同一变体。Statsig 的实践是时间片常取两周以平衡星期与时段效应，切换边界设 burn-in / burn-out 窗口剔除受遗留效应污染的曝光，分析用自助法而非普通 t 检验（<a href=\"https://www.statsig.com/blog/switchback-experiments\">Statsig — Switchback experiments</a>）。<strong>客服前置挽回</strong>这类消耗共享工时的动作就走 switchback。</li>\n<li><strong>Geo / 地域切断</strong> —— 最后的退路。门槛是<strong>簇必须真正独立</strong>：跨境场景中相邻市场共享物流干线、支付风控甚至海外仓，独立性极易被高估。落地前先用历史数据做安慰剂检验：在<strong>没有</strong>投放的历史期上跑同一套 geo 分析，若也能得出「显著提升」，说明簇选择或统计方法有问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"统计功效-方差缩减与多重比较\">统计功效、方差缩减与多重比较</h2><p>实验设计定了，能不能测出效应由功效决定。给定基线指标方差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、最小可检测效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、显著性水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与功效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，单臂样本量近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx \\frac{2\\sigma^2 (z_{1-\\alpha/2} + z_{1-\\beta})^2}{\\Delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2453em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>互动指标的现实是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 很大（复购金额、CLV 都是重尾分布）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 又很小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 迅速变成不可承受的量。两条被证明有效的出路：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，方差缩减。</strong> CUPED 用实验前的协变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 调整实验期指标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y^{cv} = Y - \\theta(X - \\bar{X})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0701em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\mathrm{Cov}(Y,X)/\\mathrm{Var}(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。此时方差缩减因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\rho^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 的相关性——若历史复购与当期复购相关性 0.6，方差降到 64%，等效于样本量涨 56%（源自 <a href=\"https://www.exp-platform.com/Documents/2013-02-CUPED-ImprovingSensitivityOfLargeScaleExperimentsAtMicrosoft.pdf\">Deng et al., CUPED, Microsoft 2013</a>）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 取「实验前 90 天复购金额」几乎总是有效，因为购后行为高度自相关。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，多重比较控制。</strong> 互动度量天然是「多指标 × 多市场 × 多分层」，不校正时假阳性会失控：独立做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 的检验，族错误率升到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-(1-\\alpha)^m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 时已达 40%。应指定<strong>一个主指标</strong>（通常为增量复购率或 iROI）做单次检验，其余作为支持性指标并报告效应量与置信区间而非 p 值；必须多维筛选时用 Benjamini–Hochberg 控 FDR，而非 Bonferroni 一刀切。</p>\n<p>还有一个特有的功效陷阱：<strong>处理效应的延迟</strong>。复购增量要几个月才沉淀完毕，若在触达后 7 天就下结论会系统性低估效应。折中是定义<strong>主判断窗口</strong>（如触达后 28 天）并明确它是「短期增量」，同时保留<strong>长期 holdout</strong> 用于季度级复核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量落地-从实验平台到治理闭环\">度量落地：从实验平台到治理闭环</h2><p>可运营系统需要四类组件：<strong>事件层</strong>消费购后状态机的迁移事件作为实验暴露与转化事件源，由<a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-event-bus-state-machine\">购后事件总线与状态机</a>提供；<strong>实验层</strong>维护分割、holdout 与 switchback 调度，并强制 holdout 不可被运营覆盖；<strong>分析层</strong>做 CUPED 调整、功效计算与多重比较控制；<strong>治理层</strong>把度量口径与合规口径对齐——评价激励的披露标记与「差评保留率」必须进入同一份报表，否则会关掉<a href=\"../onboarding-review-repurchase/review-solicitation-compliance\">评价激励合规</a>里建立的红线校验。触达量口径要与<a href=\"../tracking-proactive-communication/proactive-notification-orchestration\">主动通知编排</a>的去重逻辑一致，否则 L1 会把同一次触达重复计数，污染上层所有比率。</p>\n<p>度量治理的合格线是三条可被审计的性质：<strong>每个 L4 增量数字都能追溯到一次随机化</strong>；<strong>每个被移除的 holdout 都有审批记录</strong>；<strong>每份周报的主指标唯一且事先声明</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>互动效果度量的工程本质是把「归因」与「增量」拆成两条互不冒充的链路：归因分配已发生的转化，受身份收缩与平台模型退场（GA4 于 2023-11 移除四种归因模型）的挤压，只能作校准而非决策依据；增量估计反事实，只能由随机化得到，且随机化单元要按处理效应的作用半径选（用户级 holdout / switchback / geo）。指标按 L1 触达、L2 行为、L3 结果、L4 增量分层，只有 L4 能支撑因果陈述。能否测出效应由功效决定，方差缩减（CUPED，缩减因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\rho^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与多重比较控制（主指标唯一 + BH 控 FDR）是两个决定性杠杆，效应延迟则要求把短期判断窗口与长期 holdout 分开汇报。跨境的特殊性集中在三点：聚合日历按收件人当地日与平台结算日分离、隐私上报的加噪与阈值造成长尾缺失需由内部服务端归因兜底、geo 簇独立性必须经安慰剂检验验证。做到「增量可追溯、holdout 有审批、主指标事先声明」，度量才从报表变成可被信任的决策输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"互动效果度量与实验归因","id":"互动效果度量与实验归因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：互动度量是「归因 + 增量」两件互不顺从的事","id":"核心概念-互动度量是-归因-增量-两件互不顺从的事"},{"level":2,"text":"指标分层：从触达漏斗到增量价值","id":"指标分层-从触达漏斗到增量价值"},{"level":2,"text":"归因链路：在带噪、延迟、聚合的上报上重建","id":"归因链路-在带噪-延迟-聚合的上报上重建"},{"level":2,"text":"实验设计：holdout、switchback 与 geo 的适用边界","id":"实验设计-holdout-switchback-与-geo-的适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"统计功效、方差缩减与多重比较","id":"统计功效-方差缩减与多重比较"},{"level":2,"text":"度量落地：从实验平台到治理闭环","id":"度量落地-从实验平台到治理闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"频次控制、用户疲劳与触达偏好中心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/engagement-platform-metrics/frequency-capping-fatigue-consent"},"next":null}